
### Economic Buildings ###
# Caravanserai - Late Game Building - Massive Tax, Defender Advantage, Dev Growth % and flat value, MaA maintenance and Merc hire cost
# Watermills - Late Game Building - Massive Tax, Supply Limit, Building and Holding construction cost reduction, Holding Taxes, Dev Growth % and flat value
# Windmills - Late Game Building - Massive Tax, Supply Limit, Holding Taxes, Dev Growth % and flat value 
# Qanats - Cultural Building - Dev Growth % and flat value, Supply Limit, Travel bonus
# Murex Farms - Mediterranean Building - Influence, Dev Growth % and flat value, Tax
# Waterworks
# building_waterworks_requirement_terrain = is in India, Southeast Asia, or China, prov is county captain and terrain is NOT mountains or desert mountains
# Tradeports - Normal Tax, Prosperity
# Cattle Pastures - Poor Tax, Normal Levy, Supply Limit
# Hunting Grounds - Poor Tax, Small Levy, Defensive Advantage
# Orchards - Normal Tax, Small Levy, Prosperity
# Farm Estates - Massive Tax
# Cereal Fields - Large Tax, Mixed Bonuses
# Logging Camps - Normal Tax, Normal Build Speed
# Peat Quarries - Normal Tax, Poor Build Speed
# Hill Farms - Normal Tax, Defensive Advantage
# Elephant Pens - Normal Tax, Elephant Cavalry
# Quarries - Poor Tax, Poor Build Speed
# Plantations - Normal Tax

### Military Buildings ###
# Wind Furnaces - Good Tax, Good Stationed MaA bonuses, high Knight Effectiveness
#	- Wootz Steel Innovation
# Workshops - Late Game Building - Normal Tax, Siege Weapons, Recruitment Cost for Archers/Skirmishers, Maintenance for Archers/Skirmishers
# Horse Pastures - Low Levy, Low tax, Horse Archers, Light Cavalry, Flat Stationed MaA Screen
#	- Eastern Steppe Region/Steppe Terrain
# Hillside Grazing - Poor Levy, Heavy Cavalry, Light Cavalry, Horse Archers
#	- Certain Regions: Mountains, Desert Mountains, Hills (certain regions)
# Warrior Lodges - Poor Levy, Heavy Infantry, Pikemen, Skirmishers, Flat Stationed MaA Pursuit
#	- Certain Regions: Mountains, Desert Mountains, Hills (certain regions)
# Militia Camps - Normal Levy, Archers, Skirmishers
# Regimental Grounds - High Levy, All MaA, High MaA Maintenance
#	- Farmland, Floodplain
# Outposts - Poor Levy, Super Poor Tax, Defensive Advantage, Raid Time, Skirmishers, Archers
#	- Forest, Taiga, Jungle, Wetland
# Barracks - Normal Levy, Heavy Infantry, Pikemen
#	- Farmland, Plain, Dryland, Floodplain
# Camel Farms - Poor Levy, Super Poor Tax, Camel Cavalry, Light Cavalry
#	- Camelry Region: Desert, Floodplain, Oasis, Dryland
# Stables - Low Levy, Light Cavalry, Heavy Cavalry
# Blacksmiths - Normal Stationed MaA bonuses, Holding Taxes %, Levy Reinforcement, Low Knight Effectiveness

